{"title":"당골의 신부","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=jm2Qi/hAd4W9K0N7/K6jV9mMieG4kMktYx4Qk4K&filename=th3","synopsis":"상식 밖의 일들이 숨 쉬듯 일어나는 당골 무당 집에서 태어났지만,\n상식의 세계에서 엘리트의 삶을 살고자 노력해온 수험생 진후.\n명문대 합격 소식을 받고 이제 인생 피나 싶었던 날, 무시무시한 재앙이 일어난다.\n\n“귀문(鬼門)이 열렸구나.”\n\n그리고 밝혀지기 시작하는 진후의 비밀들…….\n아들 하나만이라도 상식의 세계로 보내주고자\n가족들은 실력파 역술인들을 모아 방도를 찾아보지만…\n\n……뭐? 지금 뭘 하라고? 심지어 상대가 누구……?!\n상식은커녕 심신마저 붕괴할 이 와중에,\n설상가상 진후 주변을 둘러싸고 거대한 재앙의 소용돌이가 시작되는데……!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":129,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":179,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":167,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":135,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":199,"change":{"type":"down","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":179,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":178,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":198,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":160,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":175,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":152,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":199,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":184,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":218,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":253,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":187,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-09